index_reviews_t1_quote: "\"Nanou offers wonderful massages in a caring and soothing environment. I feel completely relaxed after every session. A true professional!\"",
index_reviews_t1_date: "· 2 months ago",
index_reviews_t2_quote: "\"The haptonomy support during my pregnancy was magical. Nanou is attentive, gentle and professional. I recommend her without hesitation!\"",
index_reviews_t2_date: "· 1 month ago",
index_reviews_t3_quote: "\"An exceptional experience. The professionalism and gentleness of the support allowed me to reconnect with my body. I highly recommend it.\"",
index_reviews_t3_date: "· 3 weeks ago",
index_reviews_t4_quote: "\"A moment of absolute relaxation. Nanou has golden hands and creates a very soothing atmosphere. The space is beautiful and calm.\"",
index_reviews_t4_date: "· 1 week ago",
index_reviews_t5_quote: "\"Psycho-corporeal therapy with Nanou transformed my relationship with my body. A sensitive, professional and deeply human approach.\"",
index_reviews_t5_date: "· 3 months ago",
index_reviews_t6_quote: "\"The haptonomy sessions helped us build a strong bond with our baby even before birth. A precious and moving preparation.\"",
index_reviews_t6_date: "· 2 months ago",
