prestations_hero_lead: "Tailored care for your well-being",
prestations_s1_tag_detail: "Therapeutic",
prestations_s1_title_detail: "Therapeutic Massage & Thai Massage",
prestations_s1_body: "Therapeutic massage is much more than a moment of relaxation. It is an invitation to let go, to release accumulated tensions and to reconnect with your body. Through gentle and deep techniques, I guide you towards a state of profound relaxation.",
prestations_s1_duration_label: "Duration",
prestations_s1_duration_value: "60 or 90 minutes according to your needs",
prestations_s1_forwho_label: "For whom",
prestations_s1_forwho_value: "Adults seeking relaxation and balance",
prestations_s1_benefits_label: "Benefits",
prestations_s1_benefits_value: "Stress reduction, muscle relaxation, improved sleep, body-mind reconnection",
prestations_s2_tag_detail: "Birth preparation",
prestations_s2_title_detail: "Haptonomy & Perinatal Support",
prestations_s2_body: "Haptonomy is an affective approach to pregnancy that allows you to create a unique bond with your baby even before birth. Through touch and presence, I support you and your partner through this extraordinary journey.",
prestations_s2_duration_label: "Duration",
prestations_s2_duration_value: "60-minute sessions, support throughout the pregnancy",
prestations_s2_forwho_label: "For whom",
prestations_s2_forwho_value: "Expectant parents from the 4th month of pregnancy",
prestations_s2_benefits_label: "Benefits",
prestations_s2_benefits_value: "Early emotional bond with baby, self-confidence, gentle birth preparation, active participation of father/partner",
prestations_s3_tag_detail: "In-depth support",
prestations_s3_title_detail: "Psycho-corporeal Therapy",
prestations_s3_body: "Psycho-corporeal therapy allows you to work on body memories, emotional blockages and repetitive patterns. It is a path towards reconciliation with oneself, an invitation to fully inhabit your body and your life.",
prestations_s3_duration_label: "Duration",
prestations_s3_duration_value: "60 or 90 minutes, regular sessions recommended",
prestations_s3_forwho_label: "For whom",
prestations_s3_forwho_value: "Adults seeking transformation and deep healing",
prestations_s3_benefits_label: "Benefits",
prestations_s3_benefits_value: "Emotional release, self-knowledge, overcoming trauma, lasting well-being",
prestations_s4_tag_detail: "Little ones",
prestations_s4_title_detail: "Baby Massage Workshop",
prestations_s4_body: "Caring touch is essential to the development of the very young. I offer gentle sessions that help baby feel safe, relieve discomfort (colic, sleep troubles) and strengthen the parent-child bond.",
prestations_s4_duration_label: "Duration",
prestations_s4_duration_value: "60 minutes minimum — time to settle in gently",
prestations_s4_forwho_label: "For whom",
prestations_s4_forwho_value: "Babies (from birth), children and teenagers",
prestations_s4_benefits_label: "Benefits",
prestations_s4_benefits_value: "Relief of colic, improved sleep, emotional security, harmonious development",
prestations_faq_title: "Frequently Asked Questions",
prestations_faq_q1_q: "How long does a session last?",
prestations_faq_q1_a: "The duration varies depending on the treatment: 60 or 90 minutes for massages and therapy, 60 minutes for haptonomy, and at least 60 minutes for baby and child workshops.",
prestations_faq_q2_q: "Is a medical prescription required?",
prestations_faq_q2_a: "No prescription is needed. You can book an appointment directly. Some health insurance plans partially reimburse sessions — feel free to check with your provider.",
prestations_faq_q3_q: "What happens during the first session?",
prestations_faq_q3_a: "The first session begins with a conversation to understand your needs, expectations and background. We then proceed with the session itself in a safe and caring environment.",
prestations_faq_q4_q: "When can haptonomy sessions begin?",
prestations_faq_q4_a: "Ideally from the 4th month of pregnancy, but it is never too late to start. Every moment is precious for building the bond with your baby.",
prestations_faq_q5_q: "How many sessions are needed?",
prestations_faq_q5_a: "This depends on your needs and goals. A single session may be enough for a relaxation massage, while therapeutic or haptonomy support unfolds over time. We discuss this together at the first appointment.",
prestations_closing_title: "Ready to begin?",
prestations_closing_sub: "I would be delighted to accompany you on your path towards your true self.",
apropos_hero_title: "Who am I?",
apropos_hero_sub: "A humanistic and caring approach in the service of your well-being",
apropos_intro_p1: "Passionate about the human being and their potential for transformation, I trained in psycho-corporeal approaches to accompany with kindness all those who trust me.",
apropos_intro_p2: "My path led me towards therapeutic massage, haptonomy and psycho-corporeal therapy. Each of these practices has enriched me and allowed me to develop a global and holistic approach to well-being.",
apropos_intro_p3: "Today, I accompany babies, children, adults and expectant parents in their quest for balance and serenity. My approach is based on listening, respect and trust.",
apropos_intro_p4: "Based in Brussels, I receive in a warm and safe space, conducive to relaxation and introspection.",
apropos_timeline_title: "Training & Experience",
apropos_t1_badge: "Continuing education",
apropos_t1_title: "MTE practitioner in psycho-corporeal therapy",
apropos_t1_body: "Graduate of the MTE school (Brussels), in-depth training in psycho-corporeal techniques integrating work on body memories, emotions and body awareness.",
apropos_t2_badge: "Certification",
apropos_t2_title: "Perinatal haptonomy",
apropos_t2_body: "Trained in haptonomic support for expectant parents, to create an affective bond with the baby from pregnancy and gently prepare for birth.",
apropos_t3_badge: "Certification",
apropos_t3_title: "Therapeutic massage & well-being",
apropos_t3_body: "Graduate in therapeutic massage with a specialisation in deep relaxation techniques and release of tension.",
apropos_t4_badge: "Specialisation",
apropos_t4_title: "Baby & child support",
apropos_t4_body: "Specific training in caring touch for babies and young children, with particular attention to the needs of the very young.",
apropos_philosophy_title: "My philosophy",
apropos_philosophy_quote: "\"Touch is the first sense to develop in utero and the last to fade before our final journey.\"",
apropos_philosophy_p1: "The psycho-corporeal approach gives us the opportunity to let go in everyday life and to find or rediscover meaning in our body and our space. Touch is our first tangible approach to the world early in life and may have been conveyed to us as something reassuring and pleasant, or as a more difficult or even anxious impression.",
apropos_philosophy_p2: "A welcoming approach towards the newborn will give them confidence in themselves and in their surroundings. A welcoming touch towards an adult will allow them to reconcile with their body when needed.",
apropos_philosophy_p3: "Our bodily sensations accompany us everywhere and reflect our states of consciousness at a given moment. Our bodily and energetic envelope constitutes our protection and our strength.",
apropos_philosophy_closing: "Taking care of it is essential for physical and mental balance.",
apropos_values_title: "My values",
apropos_val1_title: "Kindness",
apropos_val1_body: "Every person is unique. I welcome without judgement and with empathy all those who cross my threshold.",
apropos_val2_title: "Listening",
apropos_val2_body: "Deep and attentive listening is at the heart of my practice. Your words and feelings are precious.",
apropos_val3_title: "Professionalism",
apropos_val3_body: "Continuing education, respect for professional ethics and commitment to your well-being guide my practice.",
apropos_closing_sub: "Do not hesitate to contact me for any questions or to make an appointment.",
